                                "sense_id": "9c913050-f18e-3679-a254-5c874d337915",
                                "text": "This Gueſt of Summer, / The Temple-haunting Barlet does approue, / By his loued Manſonry, that the Heauens breath / Smells wooingly here: […]"
                            },
                            {
